ple’s multitimbral MIDI synth","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(AUMIDISynth), loaded with a General MIDI sound bank, so that music can","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"be heard with no other software."}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivorconnect\/synthoutput","title":"SynthOutput","type":"topic"},"doc://IvorConnect/s9EscapableP":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorConnect\/s9EscapableP","title":"Swift.Escapable","type":"unresolvable"},"doc://IvorConnect/s8SendableP":{"title":"Swift.Sendable","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorConnect\/s8SendableP","type":"unresolvable"},"doc://IvorConnect/SH":{"title":"Swift.Hashable","type":"unresolvable","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorConnect\/SH"},"doc://IvorConnect/s16SendableMetatypeP":{"title":"Swift.SendableMetatype","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorConnect\/s16SendableMetatypeP","type":"unresolvable"},"doc://IvorConnect/SQ":{"title":"Swift.Equatable","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorConnect\/SQ","type":"unresolvable"},"doc://IvorConnect/documentation/IvorConnect/SynthOutput/Selection":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Selection","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Selection","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorConnect\/documentation\/IvorConnect\/SynthOutput\/Selection","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An instrument as a channel selects it: a patch — a program and,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"optionally, a bank — on a channel."}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivorconnect\/synthoutput\/selection","title":"SynthOutput.Selection","type":"topic"},"doc://IvorConnect/documentation/IvorConnect":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorConnect\/documentation\/IvorConnect","abstract":[{"text":"MIDI playback through CoreMIDI and Apple’s built-in General MIDI synth.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","title":"IvorConnect","role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/ivorconnect"},"doc://IvorConnect/docu